    B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P14 + P06 \u2014 cung v\xF2ng r\u1ED9ng d\u01B0\u1EDBi n\u1EAFp,
    tuy\u1EBFn ng\u1EAFn v\xE0 \u0111\xEDch nh\xECn th\u1EA5y r\xF5.\nRecovery: V\xF2ng
    cho ph\xE9p \u0111i qu\xE1 r\u1ED3i nghi\xEAng l\u1EA1i; kh\xF4ng c\xF3 khe tr\xEAn
    tr\u1EA7n ch\u1EC9 v\u1EEBa s\xE1t bi"
